sequenceDiagram
  actor student as Verified adult student
  participant api as Django API
  participant db as PostgreSQL
  participant worker as Independent worker
  participant provider as Eligible free processor
  participant storage as Private result storage
  student->>api: Request server quote for immutable input manifest
  api-->>student: Exact Credits and signed expiring quote
  student->>api: Confirm quote, language and snapshots with CSRF and idempotency key
  api->>db: Authorize owner, current consent and policy, lock key and limits
  alt Same key and body already committed
    db-->>api: Existing owned operation
    api-->>student: Same 202 operation without another reservation
  else Eligible new operation
    api->>db: Atomic reservation, operation, job, audit and logical budget slot
    db-->>api: Commit
    api-->>student: 202 operation reference
    worker->>db: Claim job, lease and fencing token, commit
    worker->>db: Recheck current consent, approval, free quota and lifecycle
    alt Gate absent or revoked before send
      worker->>db: Record proved unsent failure and release once
    else Allowed send
      worker->>db: Reserve physical allowance and persist dispatch intent
      worker->>provider: Minimized approved request with attempt identity
      alt Timeout or outcome uncertain
        worker->>db: RECONCILING, retain reservation and uncertain usage
        worker->>provider: Status lookup only if documented and permitted
      else Proved terminal refusal
        provider-->>worker: Known outcome
        worker->>db: Record rejection and release once with evidence
      else Response received
        provider-->>worker: Untrusted output and usage
        worker->>worker: Validate schema, grounding and credentials
        alt Invalid or ungrounded output
          worker->>db: Reject output and release once with proof, no reroute
        else Valid output
          worker->>storage: Stage inaccessible valid result bytes
          storage-->>worker: Immutable object version
          worker->>db: Check fence and consent, atomic result, debit, completion and audit
          db-->>worker: Commit accepted result or reject stale finalize
        end
      end
    end
  else Admission gate denied
    api-->>student: Safe error with no reservation or provider send
  end
  student->>api: GET owned operation
  api->>db: Reauthorize owner and lifecycle
  api-->>student: State and accepted result reference only after settlement
  student->>api: Review draft and approve exact document version
  api->>db: Owned hash-bound student approval, separate from AI settlement
